<details class="repair-help"><summary>What safe repair mode changes</summary><ul><li>Removes a UTF-8 BOM.</li><li>Normalizes Windows and macOS line endings.</li><li>Accepts a period as the millisecond separator.</li><li>Pads one-to-three millisecond digits.</li><li>Adds a missing hour field.</li></ul><p>Repair never reverses timestamps, shifts overlaps, invents text, or sorts captions.</p></details>
